{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":69500,"seasonNumber":6},"checkedAt":1793444866611,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":6,"name":{"value":"Stagione 6","language":"it-IT"},"year":2017,"episodeCount":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55T6xqnVBBB7MJuU7t5AkIoN7xe.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1302983","seasonNumber":6,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume helps a youkai out of a pot, and as a \"reward,\" is made young again. But Natsume is already young, and making him younger just confuses him and addles his memories. When he doesn't know who to trust, will he have the strength to know who his real friends are?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTHZimUpOYNATt29wHsgZBm9oKW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTHZimUpOYNATt29wHsgZBm9oKW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/6/episode/1"},{"id":"1316708","seasonNumber":6,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume's town is visited by a stonewasher: a powerful magical being capable of purifying tainted rocks. The stonewasher is looking for its lost student, and turns to Natsume for help.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/18e4xHu1efwqyoPU4MXq83w2UJX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/18e4xHu1efwqyoPU4MXq83w2UJX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/6/episode/2"},{"id":"1316709","seasonNumber":6,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume gets a call from his old \"friend\" Shibata, who he once helped with a youkai problem. Shibata wants him to come visit, and Natsume reluctantly agrees. He and Tanuma pay Shibata a visit, and have a pleasant chat at a park. But when Shibata mentions a local haunted house, Natsume finds his visit has turned into more than he expected...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-04-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1hkuoPLQo9bLQRvMKJJoG7xiHPN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1hkuoPLQo9bLQRvMKJJoG7xiHPN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/6/episode/3"},{"id":"1316710","seasonNumber":6,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume watches a movie starring Natori, and when he's done he finds one of Natori's paper dolls. The doll is soaked and the text on it is impossible to read, and Natsume becomes concerned for Natori's safety. He travels to the location that's just barely legible on the doll, and finds a young woman whose home is haunted by not one, but three youkai.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3BTh3ubyWPJf8CEXXQRGSYypDqv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3BTh3ubyWPJf8CEXXQRGSYypDqv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/6/episode/4"},{"id":"1316711","seasonNumber":6,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume finds that Tsukiko's home is haunted by not one, but three separate youkai, each with its own motivations. One wants to protect Tsukiko's father, and the other two...  Natori wants to exorcise them and protect Tsukiko, but Natsume wants to find some way to protect them. Is there a peaceful solution?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-05-10","